\frac{\Delta F}{\Delta x} = \left[ \frac{1}{b-a} \int_a^b f(x) dx \right] \text{Average}(f)
\Delta F = \left[ \text{Ave}(F') \right] \Delta x
\Delta F = F'(c) \Delta x \implies \text{MVT (Mean Value Theory)}

